# Build output.
/drops

# GoReleaser's output. Ignored rather than merely uncommitted: Go's vcs.modified
# comes from `git status --porcelain`, which counts untracked files, so a dist/
# git could offer to add would stamp every released binary as built from a dirty
# tree. `drops version` reports that flag.
/dist/

# Development stores. The real store stays outside this repository.
/.scratch/
*.db
*.db-wal
*.db-shm

# This repository deliberately has no hidden planning tree. Override the
# workstation's global ignore so an accidental .internal/ is visible to git.
!/.internal/
!/.internal/**
